    "job": "Link records that share a key into one person and give each person the highest stage their records reach",
    "description": "Takes records and a config. Records that share a value at any key path are one person (the same value at two different paths never links). Each person gets the highest-ranked stage any of their records reaches by the stage rules (exists, equals or greater-than tests on a field), the first source by time, the sum of a value field, and a confidence word: the identified word when any strong key is present, the anonymous word otherwise. Answers the people best stage first. Key paths, stage rules, the base stage and the confidence words are all in the config.",
    "input_schema": {
     "type": "object",
     "required": [
      "facts",
      "config"
